    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to present 9 Morton Hall to the market for sale. This is a modern two bedroom apartment situated on the first floor with good views across the town centre. The scheme is within the town centre in what is arguably the best positioned apartment scheme in Navan, it is just off Brews Hill and beside Trimgate Street and Railway Street. Morton Hall is only a small development of less than 20 apartments with a basement car park. The owners completely refurbished the apartment within the past 3 years so it is presented to the market in excellent condition.\r\n\r\nThe property compromises of an entrance hallway, modern bathroom, two spacious bedrooms one of which includes a walk in wardrobe and a spacious open plan living/ kitchen/ dining room which opens up onto a balcony providing extra space and comfort. The apartment is presented in great condition and has been very well maintained by its owners. The property also benefits from a designated underground carpark.\r\n\r\n9 Morton Hall is close to a host of local amenities including Navan Shopping Centre, restaurants, Primary and secondary schools, leisure activities and close to the Solstice Arts Centre. The immediate area also provides public transport giving easy access to the capital and neighbouring towns.\r\n\r\nViewings by appointment only."
      },
